{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"d1e2f3a4b5c6d701","type":"group","x":-1320,"y":-740,"width":1280,"height":480,"color":"5","label":"研究背景与动机"},
		{"id":"d1e2f3a4b5c6d702","type":"group","x":340,"y":-780,"width":800,"height":520,"color":"4","label":"实验设计"},
		{"id":"d1e2f3a4b5c6d703","type":"group","x":-1400,"y":90,"width":1230,"height":420,"color":"2","label":"三个核心指标"},
		{"id":"d1e2f3a4b5c6d704","type":"group","x":340,"y":90,"width":840,"height":650,"color":"1","label":"关键发现"},
		{"id":"d1e2f3a4b5c6d705","type":"group","x":-1240,"y":530,"width":920,"height":470,"color":"3","label":"已知问题与修复"},
		{"id":"d1e2f3a4b5c6d706","type":"group","x":340,"y":530,"width":900,"height":660,"color":"6","label":"研究意义与目标"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a601","type":"text","x":-260,"y":-80,"width":520,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"# The Ring Is Not the Algorithm\n**Transformer Grokking 相图研究**\n环形结构与泛化的时序关系\n$(a + b) \\bmod 53$ 模块化加法任务"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a602","type":"text","x":-820,"y":-370,"width":240,"height":60,"color":"5","text":"## 研究背景"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a603","type":"text","x":580,"y":-370,"width":240,"height":60,"color":"4","text":"## 实验设计"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a604","type":"text","x":-920,"y":140,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2","text":"## 三个核心指标"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a605","type":"text","x":580,"y":140,"width":240,"height":60,"color":"1","text":"## 关键发现"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a606","type":"text","x":-820,"y":580,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3","text":"## 已知问题与修复"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a607","type":"text","x":580,"y":580,"width":260,"height":60,"color":"6","text":"## 研究意义与目标"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a610","type":"text","x":-1280,"y":-700,"width":330,"height":220,"text":"### Grokking 现象\n**延迟泛化**：先记忆、后理解\n- 训练集：数千步达到高准确率\n- 测试集：数万步后**突然**泛化\n- Power et al. 2022 首次发现\n- 任务：$(a + b) \\bmod p$\n- 素数 $p = 53$，共 $53^2$ 个样本"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a611","type":"text","x":-900,"y":-700,"width":340,"height":220,"text":"### MIT 相图 (Liu 2022)\n在 $(\\text{lr},\\ \\text{wd})$ 对数网格上：\n| 相区 | 特征 |\n|------|------|\n| **Comprehension** | 同步快速泛化 |\n| **Grokking** | 延迟泛化 |\n| **Memorization** | 仅记忆不泛化 |\n| **Confusion** | 无法学习 |\n\n$10 \\times 10$ 对数均匀网格扫描"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a612","type":"text","x":-510,"y":-700,"width":430,"height":240,"text":"### 核心问题：三个事件的时序\n**三个关键时刻**：\n| 事件 | 符号 |\n|------|------|\n| 泛化突破 | $\\tau_{\\text{gen}}$ |\n| 傅里叶结构出现 | $\\tau_{\\text{Fourier}}$ |\n| 环形结构可见 | $\\tau_{\\text{ring}}$ |\n\n**核心假设**：$\\tau_{\\text{gen}} < \\tau_{\\text{ring}}$\n> 环形结构是事后整理，不是算法本身"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a613","type":"text","x":380,"y":-740,"width":340,"height":300,"text":"### 四阶段实验梯子\n**Stage 0**：指标验证 (6x3)\n~30 min，门控进入下阶段\n**Stage 1**：5x5 粗网格 (25x1)\n~2 hr\n**Stage 2**：相界多种子 (10x3)\n~2.5 hr\n**Stage 3**：因果干预 (2 cells)\n~1.5 hr\n\n---\n**Gate 标准 P1-P4**：\nP1: F 信号可测 · P2: CS 初始~0\nP3: $\\tau_F$ 稳定 · P4: 顺序一致"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a614","type":"text","x":760,"y":-740,"width":340,"height":280,"text":"### 模型架构\n| 参数 | 值 |\n|------|---------|\n| $p$ | 53 |\n| $d_{\\text{model}}$ | 256 |\n| heads / layers | 4 / 2 |\n| $d_{\\text{ff}}$ | 1024 |\n| 架构 | Decoder-only |\n| 输入 | $[a, b]$ |\n| 训练比例 | 30% |\n\n**扫描范围**：\nlr: $[3\\times10^{-7},\\ 4\\times10^{-2}]$\nwd: $[10^{-2},\\ 30]$"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a615","type":"text","x":-1360,"y":280,"width":310,"height":190,"text":"### $G(t)$ 泛化信号\n**定义**：每 100 步的 test_acc\n**$\\tau_{\\text{gen}}$ 判定**：\ntest_acc $\\geq 0.9$\n连续 **3 个检查点**\n\n不用 test NLL 变化点\n（会在 ~5000 步误触发）"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a616","type":"text","x":-1000,"y":280,"width":340,"height":190,"text":"### $F(t)$ 傅里叶对齐分数\n**定义**：最佳谐波 $R^2$ - 置换 null\n$F = \\max(0,\\ R^2_{\\text{best}} - R^2_{\\text{null}})$\n\n- 搜索 $k = 1 \\ldots \\lfloor p/2 \\rfloor$\n- 100 次置换校正，每 1000 步更新\n- **$\\tau_{\\text{Fourier}}$**：BIC 变化点估计\n- 自适应，无需人工阈值"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a617","type":"text","x":-610,"y":280,"width":340,"height":190,"text":"### $CS(t)$ 圆分数\n**定义**：平行四边形测试通过率\n$|E_i + E_j - E_m - E_n| < \\delta \\cdot \\bar{\\|E\\|}$\n\n- $\\delta = 0.1$，全 256 维空间\n- **不依赖 PCA 降维**\n- **$\\tau_{\\text{ring}}$**：$CS \\geq 0.8$ 持续 3 点\n- 备用：变化点估计器"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a618","type":"text","x":400,"y":280,"width":350,"height":200,"text":"### 时序发现（v2/v3 确认）\n**grok_B 跨 3 种子一致**：\n| 指标 | 中位数 |\n|------|--------|\n| $\\tau_{\\text{gen}}$ | ~12600 步 |\n| $\\tau_{\\text{Fourier}}$ | ~13700 步 |\n| $\\Delta$ | +1100 步 |\n\n**$\\tau_{\\text{gen}} < \\tau_{\\text{Fourier}}$**\n泛化先于傅里叶结构！\n$CS$ 始终 ~0.019，从不触发"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a619","type":"text","x":800,"y":280,"width":340,"height":200,"text":"### 相图扫描结果 (6x6)\n**Grokking 左簇**：\nlr ~ 1.6e-3，wd = 0.63 ~ 2.5\n**Grokking 右簇**：\nlr ~ 6.3e-3 ~ 2.5e-2，wd < 0.63\n\n**Comprehension 缺失！**\n14 个候选点穷举测试\n$p=53$ 配置下不存在\n（$p=97$ 可能存在）"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a620","type":"text","x":530,"y":540,"width":380,"height":160,"text":"### Option B: Grokking vs Memorization\n三相对比 → **两相对比**\n配对设计：同 lr，不同 wd\n\n| 组别 | lr | wd |\n|------|-------|--------|\n| grok_A/B | 1.6e-3 | 1.0 / 2.5 |\n| memo_A | 1.6e-3 | 0.04 |\n| collapse | 1.6e-3 | 10.0 |"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a621","type":"text","x":-1200,"y":700,"width":400,"height":260,"text":"### 问题 → 解决方案\n**1. Procrustes $R^2 = 0$**\nPCA top-2 无法捕捉 256D 结构\n→ 改用 **Circle Score**（全维度）\n\n**2. $\\tau_{\\text{gen}}$ 误定义**\ntest NLL 变化点在 ~5000 步误触发\n→ 改用 test_acc $\\geq 0.9$ 阈值法\n\n**3. Pilot cells 相区错误**\n4/6 超参数落错相区\n→ Step A 基线相图验证后重选\n\n**4. Circle Score 永不触发**\n$CS$ 在 256D 中始终 ~0.019\n→ 转向相动力学对比方案"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a622","type":"text","x":-750,"y":700,"width":370,"height":240,"text":"### 顺序与假设相反\n**原假设**：\n$\\tau_F < \\tau_G < \\tau_R$\n（傅里叶 → 泛化 → 环形）\n\n**实际**：$\\tau_G < \\tau_F$\n（泛化 → 傅里叶，环形缺失）\n\n**解读**：\n反而**加强**核心论点\n连傅里叶对齐也是事后的\n> \"环形结构是 cleanup artifact\""},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a623","type":"text","x":400,"y":700,"width":380,"height":200,"text":"### 核心论点\n> **\"可见的 PCA 环形结构**\n> **不是算法本身。\"**\n\n真正预测泛化的是更早出现的\n任务对齐傅里叶子空间\n圆形 PCA 可视化是\n**cleanup artifact**（事后整理产物）\n\n因果方向可能是错误的：\n泛化 → 结构，而非 结构 → 泛化"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a625","type":"text","x":830,"y":700,"width":370,"height":200,"text":"### 文献对比\n| 论文 | 我们的区别 |\n|------|----------|\n| Liu 2022 | 静态 → **动态时序** |\n| Nanda 2023 | 快照 → **全程追踪** |\n| Musat 2025 | 2层网络 → **Transformer** |\n| He 2026 | 理论 → **经验+相图** |\n\n**研究空白**：\n无论文在整张相图上测量时序"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a624","type":"text","x":400,"y":960,"width":380,"height":200,"text":"### 成功标准\n**强结果 (7-8/10)**：\n$\\geq 70\\%$ Grokking 细胞中\n$\\tau_{\\text{gen}} < \\tau_{\\text{ring}}$，概率 $> 0.8$\n\n**可发表备选**：\n诊断性进展指标\n→ 适合 ICLR Workshop\n\n**负结果**：\n证伪滞后假设 → 同样可发表"},
		{"id":"a0f1e2d3c4b5a630","type":"text","x":-240,"y":1100,"width":480,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"### 当前进度（2026-03-28）\n- [x] Idea Discovery Pipeline\n- [x] Stage 0 v1/v2/v3（全部 FAIL，完成诊断）\n- [x] Step A：6x6 基线相图\n- [x] Comprehension 搜索（14 点穷举，不存在）\n- [x] Option B 框架确立（Grokking vs Memo）\n- [ ] **Stage 1 相动力学对比运行中**\n  3 cells x 3 seeds x 50000 steps\n  新指标：dec_norm / emb_norm / gen_gap\n- [ ] Stage 2：粗网格扫描（待定）"}
	],
